    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d47">

                <pb facs="0185" n="59" sameAs="frus:frus1925v01/pg59"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A14/336: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chairman of the American Delegation</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Burton</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Geneva</hi></placeName>, [<date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-06-17"><hi rendition="#italic">June 17, 1925</hi>—(<hi
                                rendition="#italic">?</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >p.m.</hi>]</date><lb/>[Received June 17—10:30 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>90. Gibson and I signed convention, final act, protocol of signature and gas
                    protocol at 12 noon. Did not sign final declaration.<anchor n="60"
                        xml:id="d47-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Burton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
